# Domain Requirements

## Roles

- **Admin** (multiple accounts supported): dashboard, profile, edit profile, change/forgot/reset password,
  manage members, membership plans, memberships, attendance, announcements, gym timings/settings, reports, admins.
- **Member**: own login; view own profile, membership details/status, attendance, announcements.

## Member fields

Member ID, Full Name, Email, Phone Number, Date of Birth, Gender, Address, Join Date, Membership Plan,
Membership Start Date, Membership End Date, Emergency Contact, Height, Weight, Status.
Admin operations: add, edit, view, delete, search, filter, view membership, view attendance.

## Membership plans (defaults live in constants/config or DB seed — never inside components)

| Plan        | Duration  | Price   |
|-------------|-----------|---------|
| Monthly     | 1 month   | ₹1,000  |
| Quarterly   | 3 months  | ₹2,500  |
| Half-Yearly | 6 months  | ₹5,000  |
| Yearly      | 12 months | ₹10,000 |

Plan fields: Plan Name, Duration, Price, Status. Admin manages plans.
Memberships have start date, end date, `MEMBERSHIP_STATUS` (active / expired / inactive) and expiry reminders.
Each member has a payment history. Registration records the first period as paid. When that period ends, an admin marks the next period paid and may choose a different plan. The member's current plan follows the period that covers today. Members can view every previous payment.
Registered members and payments are separate admin sections. The payments section has active and expired tabs. Marking a period paid updates that list and the member's own payment history.

## Attendance (all logic in `attendance.service.js`, never duplicated across controllers)

Supports check-in, check-out, date, check-in/out times, history, today's attendance, monthly attendance,
member-wise attendance, calendar view, attendance percentage, present/absent status.

Rules:
1. A member cannot check in more than once per day — duplicate check-in is rejected. Members mark their own check-in and check-out for today. An admin can mark today live, and can record a previous day by entering the start and end time.
2. Check-out is mandatory according to the configured gym attendance workflow (from GymSettings).
3. Calculations are consistent and centralized in the backend service.

## Dashboard

StatCards: Total Members, Active Members, Expired Members, Today's Attendance, Present Members,
Absent Members, Expiring Memberships. Plus attendance chart, membership statistics, recent registrations,
recent activities, membership expiry info.

## Announcements / gym updates

Admin manages gym timing, maintenance announcements and important announcements (create/edit/delete).
Members can only view. Announcements support email notification.

## Reports (shared filtering in a reusable report service/utility — no per-report duplication)

Daily / weekly / monthly attendance, member-wise attendance, present/absent, attendance percentage,
date-range report. Export to PDF and Excel/CSV, plus print.

## Emails (via the single email service + templates)

1. New member registration · 2. Membership expiry reminder, sent on the membership end date ·
3. Announcement · 4. Password reset.
